    name: 'Hyaluronic Acid 2% + B5 (with Ceramides)',
    variant: 'Multi-molecular hyaluronic acid (sodium hyaluronate, hydrolyzed HA, HA crosspolymer) + panthenol + phospholipid/sphingolipid ceramide precursors · 30 ml · fragrance-free, alcohol-free',
